Put $H=1000\eta_0\operatorname{adj}S_0$, $Q^{01}=\eta_1\operatorname{adj}S_{01}$, $Q^{02}=\eta_2\operatorname{adj}S_{02}$. Their rank-one positive-pivot factors at the root are

